					>
						<p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">Subscriber checkout</p>
						<p class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl font-bold text-white">Get access</p>
						<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400">
							Create an account (or sign in), complete subscription, then mint MCP tokens from your dashboard.
						</p>
						<div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3">
							<Show when="signed-out">
								<a
									href={signUpUrl}
									class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-600 to-blue-600 px-6 py-3.5 text-center text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-lg transition hover:brightness-110"
								>
									Get access — sign up
								</a>
								<a
									href={signInUrl}
									class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-border-subtle px-6 py-3.5 text-center text-base font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-surface-mid"
								>
									Already subscribed? Sign in
								</a>
							</Show>
							<Show when="signed-in">
								<a
									href={accountUserUrl}
									class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-600 to-blue-600 px-6 py-3.5 text-center text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-lg transition hover:brightness-110"
								>
									Manage account
								</a>
							</Show>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Setup MCP (Cursor) -->
		<section id="setup-mcp" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6" aria-labelledby="mcp-setup-heading">
			<h2 id="mcp-setup-heading" class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-white sm:text-3xl">
				Setup MCP (Cursor)
			</h2>
			<p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-slate-400">
				<strong class="text-slate-300">In your application repo</strong>, run the bootstrap CLI, then wire the hosted MCP in
				Cursor. Tokens stay in the IDE config—not in <code class="font-mono-cta text-slate-400">.aadm/config.json</code>.
			</p>
			<ol class="mt-6 max-w-3xl list-decimal space-y-3 pl-5 text-sm text-slate-300">
				<li>
					From the repo root: <code class="font-mono-cta text-slate-300">npx aadm-init-repo --full</code> — see{' '}
					<a
						href="#bootstrap-repo"
						class="font-semibold text-accent-violet underline decoration-accent-violet/40 underline-offset-2 hover:text-accent-blue"
					>
						bootstrap details
					</a>
					.
				</li>
				<li>
					Sign in or sign up (header or “Get access”), complete subscription if you have not already.
				</li>
				<li>
					Open your account portal and create or copy an MCP-capable API key (
					<a href={accountUserUrl} class="font-semibold text-accent-violet underline decoration-accent-violet/40 underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-blue">manage account</a>
					).
				</li>
				<li>
					Paste the key into <code class="font-mono-cta text-slate-400">Authorization</code> as shown—use the raw{' '}
					<code class="font-mono-cta text-slate-400">ak_…</code> value or{' '}
					<code class="font-mono-cta text-slate-400">Bearer ak_…</code> if your client expects it.
				</li>
				<li>
					Restart MCP in Cursor (or reload the window) so it picks up the change.
				</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="mt-6 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">
				Example <span class="font-mono-cta normal-case text-slate-400">~/.cursor/mcp.json</span> fragment
			</p>
			<pre
				class="mt-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-surface-card/90 p-4 font-mono-cta text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300 sm:text-sm"
				role="region"
				aria-label="Cursor MCP JSON snippet"
			><code>{cursorMcpJsonSnippet}</code></pre>
			<p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm text-slate-500">
				Service discovery JSON lives at <code class="font-mono-cta text-slate-400">{discoveryUrl || `${cursorMcpHttpUrl}/`}</code>;
				MCP JSON-RPC posts to <code class="font-mono-cta text-accent-violet">{cursorMcpConfigUrl}</code> with Streamable HTTP (
				<code class="font-mono-cta text-slate-400">Accept: application/json, text/event-stream</code>
				)—your IDE sends that; <code class="font-mono-cta text-slate-400">mcp.json</code> uses that same URL (origin + <code class="font-mono-cta text-slate-500">/</code>).
			</p>
		</section>

		<!-- 9 Technical strip -->
		<section id="technical" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6" aria-labelledby="mcp-tech-heading">
			<h2 id="mcp-tech-heading" class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-white sm:text-3xl">
				Technical confidence (operators)
			</h2>
			<p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm text-slate-400">
				The MCP speaks over <strong class="text-slate-300">Streamable HTTP</strong>:
				<code class="font-mono-cta text-accent-violet">POST</code> with
				<code class="font-mono-cta text-slate-300">Accept: application/json, text/event-stream</code>.
				Browser GET to the MCP path without that header often returns <strong class="text-slate-300">406</strong>—expected.
			</p>
			{
				urlMcpEndpoint ? (
					<div class="mt-8 space-y-8">
						<div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3">
							{healthUrl ? (
								<a
									href={healthUrl}
									target="_blank"
									rel="noopener noreferrer"
									class="group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-surface-card/80 p-5 shadow-lg shadow-black/15 transition hover:border-slate-500/40 hover:bg-surface-mid/60"
								>
									<span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Liveness</span>
									<code class="mt-2 font-mono-cta text-sm font-semibold text-white">GET /health</code>
									<p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
										JSON probe for deploy checks and uptime monitors—not the MCP session itself.
									</p>
									<span class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-accent-violet group-hover:text-accent-blue">
										Open endpoint →
									</span>
								</a>
							) : null}
							{discoveryUrl ? (
								<a
									href={discoveryUrl}
									target="_blank"
									rel="noopener noreferrer"
									class="group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-surface-card/80 p-5 shadow-lg shadow-black/15 transition hover:border-slate-500/40 hover:bg-surface-mid/60"
								>
									<span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Discovery</span>
									<code class="mt-2 font-mono-cta text-sm font-semibold text-white">GET /</code>
									<p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
										Service JSON on the MCP host (e.g. <span class="font-mono-cta text-slate-500">mcp_endpoint</span>)
										for wiring proxies and clients.
									</p>
									<span class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-accent-violet group-hover:text-accent-blue">
										Open discovery →
									</span>
								</a>
							) : null}
							<a
								href={cursorMcpConfigUrl}
								target="_blank"
								rel="noopener noreferrer"
								class="group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-surface-card/80 p-5 shadow-lg shadow-black/15 transition hover:border-slate-500/40 hover:bg-surface-mid/60"
							>
								<span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Streamable HTTP</span>
								<code class="mt-2 break-all font-mono-cta text-sm font-semibold text-accent-blue">{cursorMcpConfigUrl}</code>
								<p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
									RPC origin your IDE <code class="font-mono-cta text-slate-500">POST</code>s to with{' '}
									<code class="font-mono-cta text-slate-500">Accept: application/json, text/event-stream</code>.
								</p>
								<span class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-accent-violet group-hover:text-accent-blue">
									Open host →
								</span>
							</a>
							<a
								href="#setup-mcp"
								class="group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-surface-card/80 p-5 shadow-lg shadow-black/15 transition hover:border-violet-500/35 hover:bg-surface-mid/60"
							>
								<span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Integrations</span>
								<span class="mt-2 font-mono-cta text-sm font-semibold text-white">Cursor · mcp.json</span>
								<p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
									Subscriber token in <code class="font-mono-cta text-slate-500">Authorization</code>, Streamable HTTP URL,
									and reload-after-save reminders.
								</p>
								<span class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-accent-violet group-hover:text-accent-blue">
									Jump to setup →
								</span>
							</a>
							{urlStandard.startsWith('http') ? (
								<a
									href={urlStandard}
									target="_blank"
									rel="noopener noreferrer"
									class="group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-surface-card/80 p-5 shadow-lg shadow-black/15 transition hover:border-slate-500/40 hover:bg-surface-mid/60"
								>
									<span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Standard</span>
									<span class="mt-2 font-display text-sm font-semibold text-white">Public AADM narrative</span>
									<p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
										Free, versioned standard text—the MCP is governed context on top of this story.
									</p>
									<span class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-accent-violet group-hover:text-accent-blue">
										Open standard →
									</span>
								</a>
							) : null}
							{urlMcpCustomerDocs ? (
								<a
									href={urlMcpCustomerDocs}
									target="_blank"
									rel="noopener noreferrer"
									class="group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-surface-card/80 p-5 shadow-lg shadow-black/15 transition hover:border-slate-500/40 hover:bg-surface-mid/60"
								>
									<span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Subscriber</span>
									<span class="mt-2 font-display text-sm font-semibold text-white">Integration docs</span>
									<p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
										Portal or handbook material for org rollout—when this URL is configured at build time.
									</p>
									<span class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-accent-violet group-hover:text-accent-blue">
										Open docs →
									</span>
								</a>
							) : null}
							<a
								href="/"
								class="group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-slate-600/60 bg-surface-card/40 p-5 transition hover:border-slate-500 hover:bg-surface-mid/40"
							>
								<span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Marketing site</span>
								<span class="mt-2 font-display text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200">About · aadm.io</span>
								<p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
									This brochure site—not the MCP JSON-RPC host.
								</p>
								<span class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-400 group-hover:text-slate-200">Home →</span>
							</a>
						</div>
						<div>
							<p class="mb-2 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">Smoke: initialize</p>
							<pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-surface-card/90 p-4 font-mono-cta text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300 sm:text-sm"><code>{curlInit}</code></pre>
						</div>
					</div>
				) : (
					<p class="mt-6 text-sm text-slate-500">
						Set <code class="font-mono-cta text-slate-400">PUBLIC_MCP_REPO_URL</code> at build time to render your MCP
						endpoint and curl on this page.
					</p>
				)
			}
		</section>

		<!-- MCP tools catalog -->
		<section class="border-t border-border-subtle bg-surface-mid/25 py-16 sm:py-20" aria-labelledby="mcp-tools-heading">
			<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6">
				<h2 id="mcp-tools-heading" class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-white sm:text-3xl">
					Typed tools & outcomes
				</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-slate-400">
					Each tool returns structured JSON for orchestrators and IDEs. After you connect,{' '}
					<code class="font-mono-cta text-slate-400">tools/list</code> and{' '}
					<code class="font-mono-cta text-slate-400">inputSchema</code> on the running server are authoritative—names below match
					the hosted AADM MCP surface.
				</p>
				<ul class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3">
					{
						mcpToolsCatalog.map((row) => (
							<li class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-surface-card/70 p-5 shadow-lg shadow-black/15">
								<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
									<code class="break-all font-mono-cta text-sm font-semibold text-white">{row.tool}</code>
								</div>
								<div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
									{row.badges.map((b) => (
										<span
											class:list={[
												'rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide',
												toolBadgeClass[b],
											]}
										>
											{b}
										</span>
									))}
								</div>
								<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">{row.outcome}</p>
							</li>
						))
					}
				</ul>
			</div>
		</section>

	</main>
</Layout>
